@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code specifics

- Skills live in `.agents/skills/`; `.claude/skills` is a symlink to it.
- `KB_ACTOR` is set in `.claude/settings.json`, so `uv run kb new` fills
  `generated.by`. Update it there when the model changes.
- Hooks: after each Write/Edit in `{{ bundle_dir }}/`, the edited file is validated. On
  stop, every page this session changed (via Write/Edit or `kb` commands)
  must pass `kb check`, the indexes above them must be fresh, and knowledge
  edits need a `log.md` entry. Hook output tells you exactly what to fix;
  run `just check` for the whole bundle.
